--
--  Method call                      Return              Description
--  ===========                      ======              ===========
--  close()                          -                   Close form handler
--  equAssQuery()                    -                   Constructor
--  initialise()                     -                   Initialise create mode
--  setup(DBREF)                     -                   Setup form with passed element
--  showRestrictions()               -                   Show a table of association restrictions for the given association
--  testResult(DBREF)                STRING
--  tidy()                           -                   Tidy up form data
--
